# Guidance-file style

Full context: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

- Use imperatives, not vague passives.
- Copy build / test / lint commands verbatim from
  [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) — do not paraphrase.
- State MSRV and edition identically everywhere: Rust 1.75, edition
  2021.
- Point at [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the source of truth instead
  of restating rules across files.
- Do not invent tool conventions. If a tool has no publicly documented
  file format, do not fabricate one.
